Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.37,0:00:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one who wants\Nthe answer to that question.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.93,0:00:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.11,0:00:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.67,0:00:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're on me like white on rice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.37,0:00:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.29,0:00:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell do I make the rest of\Nthis stupid prediction come true?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.29,0:00:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.31,0:00:52.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you find the person\Ntailing us? Say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.31,0:00:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all of the elders,\Nwe'll be here soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.85,0:01:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.77,0:01:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I gonna get out of this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chariot!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.19,0:01:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.29,0:01:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad! I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.43,0:01:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the fastest quick draw around!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.95,0:01:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now don't move or you're dead! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.63,0:01:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say something?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.15,0:01:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it, ref!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.23,0:01:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold around!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.21,0:01:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.41,0:01:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been here the\Nentire time. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.63,0:01:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you find someone following us or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.13,0:01:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.83,0:01:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is getting uglier by the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.69,0:01:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've backed me into a corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.39,0:01:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to that full comic book?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.59,0:01:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was supposed to give my big chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After I stuck my fingers\Nup Polnareff's nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But everything has gone south.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.39,0:02:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm about to be in a\Nwhole world of trouble.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.48,0:02:13.32,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,953)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.71,0:02:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The period of one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.23,0:02:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop! Good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beginning of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.47,0:03:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.61,0:03:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.03,0:03:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.99,0:03:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Crusaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.91,0:03:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last page. In the last page.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.19,0:03:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,End of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.71,0:03:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the memory of the bloodline?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.65,0:03:43.24,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,477)\pos(151,875)}Episode 37: Hol Horse and Mondatta, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'm gonna cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.65,0:03:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Had I known something like\Nthis was gonna happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.01,0:03:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would've just blown\Nhim away from a distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.39,0:04:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mondatta, this is all\Nyour fault, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.25,0:04:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That fool Polnareff's sword would've\Nhad nothing on my gun. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.19,0:04:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.01,0:04:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You waiting for an invitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.95,0:04:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell the scram.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.23,0:04:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I swear to you, Polnareff, if I'm\Nfound out, I'm taking you down with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.19,0:04:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.11,0:04:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.02,0:04:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one was tailing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.21,0:04:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess it was just my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.49,0:04:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.71,0:04:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And is there any particular reason you're
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nonchalantly standing\Nin the corner like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.15,0:04:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell him that you wanted to\Nfind a place to take a leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.93,0:04:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it, or I'll put a bullet in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.87,0:04:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I had to take a whiz and\Ncouldn't find a toilet, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what can you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.67,0:04:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.55,0:04:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, you were peeing in the street?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.99,0:04:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after all this time,\Nyour lack of shame amazes me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.99,0:04:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the love of, stop jabbing\Nthat stupid gun into my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.05,0:05:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I may have found a way out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.45,0:05:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give them a signal and\Nhope to God they figure it out.
