Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.67,0:05:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look where my tongue is pointing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.89,0:05:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.19,0:05:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to give you a sign!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.99,0:05:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look behind me! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.13,0:05:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behind me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.97,0:05:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.79,0:05:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd they stop talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.99,0:05:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, as you can see, there's nothing strange\Ngoing on here, so you can go on ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.87,0:05:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.70,0:05:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you not catching on? My tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.09,0:05:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at my tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.43,0:05:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.83,0:05:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.97,0:05:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.77,0:05:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're making a creepy face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.41,0:05:55.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something wrong with your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.13,0:05:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.04,0:06:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to tell us that\Nthere's something behind...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.73,0:06:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.73,0:06:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.73,0:06:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You low-down dirty son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.11,0:06:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were gluing him in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.11,0:06:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've pissed me off for the last time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.15,0:06:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had just about\Nenough of you! Now, die!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.89,0:06:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.41,0:06:21.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.99,0:06:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing here? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.05,0:06:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had to sneeze?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.23,0:06:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.41,0:06:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whole Horse is back and he's got a friend\Nhiding under the crate so be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.31,0:06:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Blast it this can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.47,0:06:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sneezed because I wouldn't\Njab my fingers up his nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.01,0:06:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn damn if Polnareff\Nhadn't sneezed the very
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.87,0:06:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,least I could have gotten\Nrid of him for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.07,0:07:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have known better than to\Nteam up with the likes of you Mondatta.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.11,0:07:02.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now they're gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.77,0:07:07.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all happening because\Nof that blasted premonition!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.07,0:07:10.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.11,0:07:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, bro, you seeing what I'm seeing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.11,0:07:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like that jackass\Nthat picked a fight with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.69,0:07:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's him, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.65,0:07:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget the face of\Nthe bastard that blew my ear off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.63,0:07:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll run him over like\Na piece of roadkill!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.07,0:07:27.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.83,0:07:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
