Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.71,0:07:47.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.95,0:07:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all happened so fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.73,0:07:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they didn't have a\Nchance to whip out their
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.07,0:07:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stands and stop the truck\Nfrom running them down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.39,0:07:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fingers went up his nose\Nand the prediction came true!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.45,0:07:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.19,0:08:01.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got all four of them at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.51,0:08:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My premonitions are always right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.17,0:08:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, it's too soon for\Nyou to finish them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.47,0:08:11.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must wait for the next\Nprediction to be revealed, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.33,0:08:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
