Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.87,0:08:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro wasn't hit head on by the\Ntruck like Joseph and the others were.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:08:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.67,0:09:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we tried creeping up to him, there's\Na chance he could have laid us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.49,0:09:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, he's looking for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.89,0:09:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Probably wondering why I\Nsplit instead of blowing his
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,head clear off when I thought\Nhe was down for the count.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.71,0:09:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are gonna be able to\Nbeat these yahoos right
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.43,0:09:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've made it this far\Nafter all i have to win
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.73,0:09:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what it takes\Nyou got that are you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.25,0:09:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with me mondata yeah we're\Nso close i can taste it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.09,0:09:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mondata it's time to\Ntake these guys out once
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.37,0:09:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and for all so what's our next move you've
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.73,0:09:32.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,proven That your comics\Npredictions are 100
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.71,0:09:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,accurate i was wrong but i believe in you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.13,0:09:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now and i'll do Whatever i must need me to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.29,0:09:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stick my fingers up\Nsomething i will need me
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.57,0:09:42.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to eat crap I'll do it without a second
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.23,0:09:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thought i have to win\Nthis fight no matter what
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.07,0:09:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's here it finally appeared. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.85,0:09:56.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's the final prediction\Nwhat the time has
