Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once they're fired, the bullets go\Nthrough the pipe and out the other end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.57,0:11:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaboom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.67,0:11:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hull Horse's bullets hit their mark and\Nfly straight through Jotaro's skull!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.49,0:11:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right smack in the middle of his forehead!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.87,0:11:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.47,0:11:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's finally happening, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.99,0:11:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our time's come, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.93,0:11:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this since\Nmy brother's accident, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.73,0:11:27.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great, Mondatta!
