Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.15,0:11:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make sure we give it a thorough\Nonce-over so we don't get our bacon cooked.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.30,0:11:39.76,SFX31,Forgot,0,0,0,,{=44}{\blur1\frz348.6\c&H344040&\move(1629,376,1309.48,375.88,22,2441)}Kablam {In preview for last episode}
Dialogue: 2,0:11:37.30,0:11:39.76,SFX31,Forgot,0,0,0,,{=44}{\bord0\blur1\frz348.6\4a&HFF&\move(1629,376,1309.48,375.88,22,2441)}Kablam {In preview for last episode}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.95,0:11:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening on this page?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:44.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is the prediction from when\Nyour brother tried to wipe out Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.57,0:11:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in the end, your brother was\Nthe one who got himself blown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.57,0:11:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but my brother transformed himself\Ninto Jotaro without giving it any thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.11,0:11:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he hadn't, the prediction\Nwould have come true, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.59,0:12:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's not going to happen to us\Nbecause you and I can't transform ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.97,0:12:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.07,0:12:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.01,0:12:08.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have changing powers, so I couldn't\Npretend to be Jotaro if I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.17,0:12:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, then does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.29,0:12:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It does indeed, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.45,0:12:16.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last I can avenge my brother, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.39,0:12:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's absolutely no way to\Nmisinterpret this prophecy, yes!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:16.46,0:12:20.09,AASFX1,12.1,0,0,0,,{=88}{\blur0.9\frz21.53\c&HC4D0D1&\move(321.89,611.11,55.54,265.45,26,3613)}Doom
