Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's back up a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.49,0:12:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It gave us a specific\Ntime to do it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.29,0:12:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gotta be done by the stroke of noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.33,0:12:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your magic prediction comic\Nbook neglected to mention
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we only have two minutes\Nleft before 12 o 'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.67,0:12:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't panic!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.47,0:12:54.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is\Naim your gun and fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.23,0:12:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you have more than enough time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.45,0:12:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, just believe in fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.11,0:12:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll work itself out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.39,0:13:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.87,0:13:01.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.25,0:13:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe you, I really do, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.87,0:13:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're down to the wire\Nand time's against us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.11,0:13:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a whole ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.39,0:13:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there, worker guys, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.69,0:13:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a matter of life and death!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need one of you to open\Nthat pipe on the double!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.23,0:13:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do it, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.45,0:13:27.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, who exactly do you think\Nyou're barking orders at?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.57,0:13:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think you are, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.93,0:13:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take a hike.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.01,0:13:33.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, open the pipe, or\Nyou can die! Pole Horse,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.83,0:13:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should know that ordinary people\Ndon't have the ability to see your stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.45,0:13:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.99,0:13:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.87,0:13:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to the premonition in the\Ncomic, you're supposed to pay the workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.53,0:13:45.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.45,0:13:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.45,0:13:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a minute, 10 seconds\Nleft before showtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.35,0:13:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.53,0:13:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about the attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.05,0:13:56.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pay you to open the pipe,\Nbut you have to do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.69,0:13:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.61,0:13:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're gonna pay us?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.29,0:14:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weirdo, why would you give\Nus money to open the pipe?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.47,0:14:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it really matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.73,0:14:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand over what you got.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.11,0:14:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.37,0:14:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, what's the holdup, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.13,0:14:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A flap broke!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.79,0:14:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.85,0:14:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left my wallet at the hotel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.61,0:14:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.95,0:14:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mondatta!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.87,0:14:25.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember the money I gave to you just\Nin case you ended up getting lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.79,0:14:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I need you to give it back to\Nme, so fork it over now, Mondatta!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.59,0:14:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:32.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.65,0:14:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've only got 40 seconds left!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.23,0:14:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.79,0:14:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.71,0:14:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I-I don't know if this is\Nenough, but go ahead and take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.83,0:14:41.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.23,0:14:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.69,0:14:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I think I saw one of\Nthem roll behind the bricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.51,0:14:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're just coins, but\Nthere are a lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.27,0:14:52.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.19,0:14:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be at least 20 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.05,0:14:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, watch your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.17,0:14:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're stepping on one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.09,0:14:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.00,0:14:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.91,0:14:58.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pick up the damn coins later!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.03,0:15:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have them all, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.71,0:15:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.53,0:15:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting close to noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.31,0:15:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made you boys some tea, so take\Na load off and have some lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.49,0:15:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.23,0:15:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Granny, I found\Nthem first, so get lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.41,0:15:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, ma 'am.
