Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.39,0:15:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's open!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.73,0:15:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.47,0:15:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now die, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.49,0:15:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.87,0:15:44.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like the predictions said, I shot\Nthe cocky bastard at the stroke of noon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.87,0:15:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.05,0:15:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, time to get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think there's\Nany permanent damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.33,0:16:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only have cuts and bruises.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.83,0:16:08.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Polnareff, on the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.79,0:16:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't mean to be a nuisance, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.47,0:16:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could someone get this\Ndamn thing off of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.31,0:16:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.71,0:16:22.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really gonna happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.61,0:16:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tojoro's right in front of that pipe!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.51,0:16:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Ah, shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.79,0:16:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.89,0:16:46.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.07,0:16:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.89,0:16:51.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what Whole\NHorse was thinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.91,0:16:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he decided sticking\Nhis fingers on my nose?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.85,0:16:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would be the perfect way\Nto spend the evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.93,0:16:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy is très disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.39,0:17:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my nose still itches.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.37,0:17:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So sorry again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.19,0:17:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how's it possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.51,0:17:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My bullets missed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.07,0:17:09.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.15,0:17:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you trying to pull one over on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.31,0:17:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.41,0:17:16.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.23,0:17:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said, my predictions\Nalways come true. It's fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.47,0:17:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.81,0:17:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not once since I started using my stand\Nhave my predictions ever been wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.15,0:17:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, clearly there's a first time for\Neverything because they're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.73,0:17:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a single bullet hit his mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.63,0:17:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's safe to say your\Nprediction was totally wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.97,0:17:35.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.83,0:17:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for joining us\Nfor today's broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.35,0:17:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be sure to tune in next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.87,0:17:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now for the 12 o 'clock news.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.41,0:17:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.01,0:17:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.05,0:17:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way in hell\Nit's just now. Noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.99,0:17:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.19,0:17:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My watch is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.21,0:18:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My watch is fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that means I ended up firing\Noff the bullets before it was time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.09,0:18:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now it is, Noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.79,0:18:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that mean for us, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.35,0:18:14.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what the hell's going to happen\Nto us now that we've gone off script?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.53,0:18:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.79,0:18:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where do we get off track?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.57,0:18:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It said the bullets will go right through
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.17,0:18:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe Tarot's forehead\Nat the stroke of noon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.61,0:18:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hall Horse, the bullets are...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.09,0:18:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
