Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.14,0:18:41.18,SFXRed,17,0,0,0,,{=83}{\blur0.6\frz14.05\pos(861,538.67)\c&H0B0414&}Boom
Dialogue: 2,0:18:41.14,0:18:41.18,SFXRed,17,0,0,0,,{=83}{\bord0\blur0.6\frz14.05\pos(861,538.67)\4a&HFF&}B{*\c&H4703D4&}o{*\c&H5806DA&}o{\c&H6809E1&}m
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.67,0:18:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, tell me I'm not the only one\Nwho heard that ear-piercing scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.03,0:18:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not clear on the details, but\Nthere's something fishy going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.67,0:18:54.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the bigger concern is this truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.81,0:18:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we'd better get out of here\Nbefore the cops start showing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.13,0:18:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's move, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.25,0:19:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But before we go, I want to know where\NWhole Horse ran off to. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.95,0:19:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He disappeared for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.57,0:19:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, if you don't get away from that\Npipe, you're going to get soaking wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.29,0:19:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should try to be more careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.99,0:19:25.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.23,0:19:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but he's critical.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.61,0:19:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even begin to tell\Nyou what transpired here today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.45,0:19:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They looked him over and it\Nseems as though the bullet
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.91,0:19:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,went through his forehead\Nand out the top of his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.29,0:19:40.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One centimeter lower, and\Nhe would have been a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.37,0:19:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oof.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.29,0:19:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta say, that is one lucky man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.25,0:19:50.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the end, it seems my\Nprediction was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.69,0:19:55.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means this was Whole\NHorse's fate all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.41,0:19:58.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jojo is really something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.63,0:20:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How lucky can one person be?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.13,0:20:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both my brother and Whole\NHorse were defeated by fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.51,0:20:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point, we stand\Nusers are wasting our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.81,0:20:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Days, the only\None who can defeat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.35,0:20:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what, Zenyatta?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.43,0:20:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whole Horse, that big buffoon of a man,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.29,0:20:20.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taught me that revenge is\Nnothing more than a massive joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.13,0:20:23.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, I'm going to forget about Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.35,0:20:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a new path in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.31,0:20:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use my stand's powers to\Nhelp as many people as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.19,0:20:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use them to bring\Nhappiness to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.51,0:20:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe people will start to like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.67,0:20:38.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just maybe our\Nfuture will be brighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.41,0:20:44.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired of being afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.19,0:20:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today's the last day I spend under\Na box cowering from everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.81,0:20:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I learned a lot from this battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.79,0:20:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More than I thought I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.43,0:20:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming home now, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.41,0:20:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm coming home to ask one to join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.73,0:21:00.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.85,0:21:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.05,0:21:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kicked it without thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.61,0:21:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.69,0:21:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.31,0:21:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dog, he looks familiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.03,0:21:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty sure I've seen him before.
