Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.41,0:21:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.03,0:21:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.99,0:21:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.73,0:21:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.73,0:21:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.07,0:21:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, now that I think about\Nit, where'd our dumbass dog go?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.57,0:21:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're talking about Iggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.05,0:21:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he's scrounging\Naround for food somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:38.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've said from the beginning he\Nwouldn't help us when we needed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.67,0:21:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He should have known it\Nwouldn't be so simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.45,0:21:45.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If people could change that\Neasily, life wouldn't be so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.05,0:21:49.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So as fate would have it, Mondatta\Njoined Hol Horse in the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.81,0:21:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only now, he was meager than ever before.
