Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.93,0:21:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.13,0:21:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you believe it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.79,0:22:01.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.43,0:22:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell Horse! Bang! Company!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.97,0:22:07.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the player of the Hall Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.89,0:22:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The card's name is Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.97,0:22:17.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to fight with the two-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.49,0:22:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to fight with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.97,0:22:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.73,0:22:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a Boingo man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.09,0:22:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a Bang
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.35,0:22:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-go man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.37,0:22:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.59,0:22:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.59,0:22:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is how it's going to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.63,0:22:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have to believe it's\Ngoing to be a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.35,0:22:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that you're going to\Nprint it out is the best thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.87,0:22:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the best thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.77,0:23:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact that you're going\Nto be the best thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.33,0:23:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're going to do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.85,0:23:06.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's all going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.95,0:23:08.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.43,0:23:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.35,0:23:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hot Horse, Boingo, Duo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.81,0:23:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.79,0:23:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OK, I believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.41,0:23:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hot Horse, Boingo, Duo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.51,0:23:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The truth is that I can't read correctly!
